// EssentialWatch firmware - Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-2.06 (410x502 colour AMOLED, FT3168 touch)
// Port of the e-ink EssentialView firmware (firmware/src/main.cpp) to the colour display:
// - same NMEA sentences (WiFi TCP, optional RS485), same menus and web page;
// - physical buttons replaced by touch: virtual keys at the bottom of the menus,
//   on the dashboard swipe = change page, long press = menu, double tap = day/night theme;
// - drawing on an off-screen buffer (Arduino_Canvas) copied whole to the panel: no flicker.
// Page 1: clock.  Page 2: wind dial (AWA/TWA, AWS/TWS in the centre).
// Page 3: SOG + depth.  Page 4: AIS boats on a collision course or very close (max 5).  Page 5: battery (top) + brightness (bottom).

